# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2048 AI -- what stays out of version control
#
# Rule of thumb: if the project can regenerate it, it does not belong here.
# Everything below is either rebuilt on demand, specific to one machine, or
# far too large for Git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- trained weights, checkpoints and snapshots ----------------------------
# The default 4x6 network is a 268 MB float32 file; GitHub rejects anything
# over 100 MB, and even the small networks are pure derived data. Train your
# own (see the README) or download a release asset if one is published.
checkpoints/
*.f32

# --- run data: history, evaluations, status, experiment results ------------
# status.json also records a local PID, and history/evaluation logs describe
# one particular machine's run.
data/
*.jsonl

# --- rebuildable lookup tables ---------------------------------------------
# data/tables/idx-*.bin is a cache of n-tuple index tables (22-34 MB each).
# Deleting it costs one rebuild of a few seconds.
*.bin

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# --- virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
pyvenv.cfg

# --- test and tooling caches -----------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/

# --- logs, PIDs and other runtime scratch ----------------------------------
*.log
nohup.out
*.pid
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# --- editors and IDEs ------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.\#*
\#*\#

# --- operating-system metadata ---------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in this project needs credentials. These patterns are here so that
# an accidentally created key or token file cannot be committed by reflex.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*credentials*
*secret*
.netrc

# --- exceptions ------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation images are checked in deliberately.
!docs/images/*.png
